# a named company is recorded and answered
think read extract
call_tool record Airtable:create_records_for_table
think reply write
ask gate
call_tool send Gmail:send_message
done

# no company still routes through the CRM
think read extract
call_tool record Airtable:create_records_for_table
think reply write
ask gate
call_tool send Gmail:send_message
done

# a CRM failure takes the error port and flags it
think read extract
call_tool record Airtable:create_records_for_table
say flag
done
